Subject: Cantor Identity Accounting Workspace P0 Solution

& [ImplementedSolution]
  + IdentityLedger is the deterministic complete basket authority with stable readable typed handles and SHA-256 content custody
  + AccountabilityRegister projects every full object record in ordered inference-facing form and refuses budget-driven truncation
  + AccountabilityInferenceWindow binds the register to one validated SharedAttentionFrame and exact ledger identity
  + ReferenceResolution distinguishes exact unique ambiguous and unknown reference outcomes without fuzzy auto-selection
  + AccountableObjectPatch performs one-object compare-and-set updates while conserving membership and immutable identity fields
  + AttentionReceipt requires an explicit disposition for every register member and holds any unresolved account

& [NextBoundary]
  + persistence and event history
  + inference-host query and response protocol
  + scoped basket decomposition with parent manifests
  + Judgment integration and effect authorization remain separate governed successors
